  <p id="tag">This text will scroll and a Pause/Scroll link will be present 
  when JavaScript and CSS are supported and active.</p>
</div>
...
```

#### The CSS component

```css
...
body {
  font:1em verdana,sans-serif;
  color:#000;
  margin:0
}

#scroller {
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  width:15em;
  border:1px solid #008080;
}

#tag {
  margin:2px 0;
}

#testP {
  visibility:hidden;
  position:absolute;
  white-space:nowrap;
